WEBVTT

00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:02.984
Once you finish, ask the agent to organize the material

00:00:03.053 --> 00:00:07.709
into a goal, people, desired experience, constraints,

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:12.202
known facts, assumptions, questions, and non-goals.

00:00:12.806 --> 00:00:16.022
A non-goal is something the project intentionally does not

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:16.579
attempt.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:20.503
This organized response is a readback: a statement of what

00:00:20.538 --> 00:00:21.885
the agent believes you meant.

00:00:22.268 --> 00:00:24.068
It is not yet your architecture.

00:00:24.451 --> 00:00:26.204
It gives you a surface to correct.

00:00:26.645 --> 00:00:29.582
Tell the agent, "Repeat this back before choosing tools or

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:30.325
writing code.

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:33.460
Point out contradictions and wait for my correction."
